  // to requested change2 (rodata34ff6d0).230afe0 type1 matches only a
  // great result from its specified stage;2303164(change2) sets locked1.
  // Otherwise2302524 sets5 for no rules OR a great result. Counter setters
  // are absent here: do not invent a cumulative or other-clear increment.
